From: René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>
Subject: [PATCH] gdb: add the i860 target

Adds gdb/i860-tdep.c. The gdb tarball has its own bfd, opcodes and include, from which i860 was removed, so this restores those too. Generated configure and Makefile.in were patched by hand and not regenerated.

For the gdb-18.1 release tarball, git tag gdb-18.1-release. Tested in the MAME magicst2 model only, not on real hardware.

Signed-off-by: René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 bfd/Makefile.am        |    5 +
 bfd/Makefile.in        |    6 +
 bfd/archures.c         |    4 +
 bfd/bfd-in2.h          |   43 +
 bfd/config.bfd         |   14 +-
 bfd/configure          |    2 +
 bfd/configure.ac       |    3 +
